---
// About Us Page - Minnaar-Matthews Creative House
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>About Us | Minnaar-Matthews</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Jost:wght@300;400;500&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;0,700;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  </head>
  <body style="margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #1A1A1A; color: #F5F2EB; font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
    
    <!-- Header Navigation -->
    <header style="padding: 2rem 3rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);">
      <a href="/" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; letter-spacing: 0.2em; font-size: 1.125rem; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F5F2EB; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;">Minnaar-Matthews</a>
      
      <nav style="display: flex; gap: 2rem; align-items: center;">
        <a href="/" style="font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.35em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F5F2EB; text-decoration: none; opacity: 0.8;">Home</a>
        <a href="/about" style="font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.35em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F5F2EB; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid #F5F2EB; padding-bottom: 2px;">About Us</a>
        <a href="/portfolio" style="font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.35em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F5F2EB; text-decoration: none; opacity: 0.8;">Portfolio</a>
        <a href="/review" style="font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.35em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F5F2EB; text-decoration: none; opacity: 0.8;">Review</a>
        <a href="/contact" style="font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.35em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F5F2EB; text-decoration: none; opacity: 0.8;">Contact</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content Area -->
    <main style="flex-grow: 1; max-width: 48rem; margin: 0 auto; padding: 6rem 2rem; text-align: center;">
      <span style="font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.4em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #9A958D; display: block; margin-bottom: 1rem;">Our Philosophy</span>
      
      <h1 style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif; font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 4vw, 3.5rem); font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F5F2EB; margin: 0 0 2rem 0;">
        Design with Intention
      </h1>

      <div style="width: 3rem; height: 1px; background-color: #5A554D; margin: 0 auto 2.5rem auto;"></div>

      <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 300; color: #C5C0B6; letter-spacing: 0.05em; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
        Minnaar-Matthews Creative House is built on the pursuit of uncompromising precision, timeless spatial compositions, and bespoke digital experiences. We believe that true luxury lies in restraint, clarity, and deep attention to detail.
      </p>

      <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; font-weight: 300; color: #C5C0B6; letter-spacing: 0.05em; line-height: 1.8;">
        Operating from Cape Town, our work spans visual storytelling, architectural aesthetics, and clean modern web engineering—merging creative artistry with technical excellence.
      </p>
    </main>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer style="padding: 2rem 3rem; text-align: center; font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: 0.3em; text-transform: uppercase; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); color: #9A958D;">
      &copy; 2026 Minnaar-Matthews Creative House. All Rights Reserved.
    </footer>

  </body>
</html>